        "wild": "Dimorphodon equesica is a tiny flying reptile that is generally harmless on its own. However, it nests in large groups and will swarm anything that threatens its territory. A single Dimorphodon is little more than a nuisance, but a flock of them can overwhelm a survivor in seconds with their razor-sharp beaks.",
